<title>PAKISTAN: At least four killed in attack in Karachi.</title>
<headline>At least four killed in attack in Karachi.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gunmen attacked an office of an ethnic party in Pakistan's southern port of Karachi on Monday, killing four people and wounding several, party officials said.</p>
<p>Officials of the Mohajir National Movement (MQM) said four attackers in a yellow vehicle had fired on the MQM office in the Risala area of District South as they drove by.</p>
